  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your maximum psionic power is “more than maximum.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Maximize Power, 7th mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you manifest a power affected by Maximize Power, all variable, numeric effects of the power are treated as 150% of their maximum.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you may expend two uses of mythic power to manifest a power as a maximized power (gaining only the normal benefits of a maximized power, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without increasing the number of power points spent or expending psionic focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> All variable, numeric effects of a maximized power are automatically at their highest value.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc35\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
